"Included with Burrow. Engine updates arrive through signed Burrow releases so the app's Developer ID seal stays valid." = "In Burrow enthalten. Engine-Updates kommen über signierte Burrow-Releases, damit die Developer-ID-Signatur der App gültig bleibt.";
